&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Unity is at the forefront of mobile advertising technology, helping developers and advertisers create thriving ecosystems through our innovative User Acquisition (UA) and monetization solutions. As a Senior Client Partner on the Unity Ads team, you&#39;ll manage relationships with top advertisers in the Greater China region, helping them achieve their UA marketing goals and optimize their advertising performance as well as publishers revenue. You&#39;ll act as the main point of contact for 360 client management utilizing our suite of solutions, including UnityAds, Offerwall and Unity Levelplay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting role for someone passionate about gaming, mobile advertising, strategy, and relationship-building. You’ll play a key part in managing client needs while contributing to Unity’s regional growth targets in mobile monetization and performance UA advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow a portfolio of gaming advertisers, acting as their main point of contact to drive campaign performance and deliver on revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to upsell and cross-sell Unity’s UA/Monetization solutions across platforms, while proactively addressing client needs and campaign challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal teams (Product, Performance, Technical Support, Legal, Finance) to ensure smooth execution and delivery of advertiser goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and lead Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs), providing strategic insights and performance recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Unity at key industry events and client meetings to deepen relationships and position Unity as a UA and monetization leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in mobile advertising, particularly in user acquisition or monetization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record in Account Management, Business Development, or Sales, with measurable revenue success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and data interpretation skills to drive optimization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication and collaboration skills, comfortable working across teams and managing multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid presentation skills and confidence in leading performance reviews with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support is not available for this position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work visa/immigration sponsorship is not available for this position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
