&lt;h1 data-local-id=&quot;9617671ceeb6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Skyscanner&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;d5d6cd0890c8&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Everyone loves travelling, but planning is not without its challenges ✈️. That&#39;s why we&#39;ve spent 20 years building tools that turn travel-planning chaos into a breeze. Today, around 100 million travellers count on us every month to skip the whole &quot;47 browser tabs open&quot; phase and find flights, cars, and hotels quickly and easily 💻.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6bd2df936519&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Joining Skyscanner means becoming part of a global brand that&#39;s striving to become the planet&#39;s go-to travel hack accessible for all 🌍.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;2e5fc956c6ab&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our vision? To be the world&#39;s number one travel ally. (Ambitious? 💪 Yes, but, hey, that&#39;s what got us here)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-local-id=&quot;2712199a2be3&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;rule&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 data-local-id=&quot;70cdc76bf4fd&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;b69a5ae31b0d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;em&quot;&gt;(Shenzhen)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;b69a5ae31b0d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;em&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a contractor role for an initial about six-month term till end of 2026.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;fc05bf2ada64&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Your mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the delivery of all IT infrastructure workstreams — AV, networking, and security — within our new Shenzhen office fit-out programme, acting as the &lt;span id=&quot;bf680b19-a5f2-446d-b429-9e7909fae86d&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;bf680b19-a5f2-446d-b429-9e7909fae86d&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;bridge between Employee Enablement, the Workplace team, and our external contractors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;23309091c926&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Your impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll make sure that when our &lt;span id=&quot;36ac504e-9cab-431f-a97c-d04121bf89d2&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;36ac504e-9cab-431f-a97c-d04121bf89d2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;annotation&quot;&gt;people walk into the new space&lt;/span&gt;, everything just works — the screens, the networks, the access controls. You&#39;ll own the IT delivery end-to-end, keeping it on time, on budget, and built to a standard we&#39;re proud of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-local-id=&quot;f7fdf6a99096&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;rule&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 data-local-id=&quot;931a02e00453&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;heading&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;157b9adcceb3&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Delivering AV, networking and security:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;em&quot;&gt;Accountable for the end-to-end delivery of&lt;/em&gt; the AV, networking, and physical/electronic security workstreams within the fit-out programme — &lt;em data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;em&quot;&gt;ensuring project plans, schedules, and risk registers are maintained and delivery teams are on track.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;35e22ec27c43&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Connecting Workplace and Employee Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Serving as the primary point of contact between the Workplace team and Employee Enablement for all IT-related aspects of the fit-out, representing IT interests in programme governance meetings and resolving cross-functional dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;3a05828b8980&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Coordinating with the main contractor:&lt;/strong&gt; Acting as the single IT interface with the main contractor — coordinating access, scheduling, and sequencing of IT works within the broader programme of works.&lt;/p&gt;
