&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;a86bc0f75964&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We&#39;re committed to ensuring our application and recruitment processes are inclusive and accessible to everyone. If you require any reasonable adjustments or accommodations for interviews, and/or wish to apply under the Disability Confident scheme, please let your recruiter know. If you&#39;d like more information on any of our policies, such as hybrid working or Parental Leave policies (typically we pay a minimum of 24 weeks birth parent/maternity leave globally), our recruitment team can provide more information on these.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The APAC Growth Partner is a strategic role driving revenue growth by partnering with mobile developers across APAC. The role manages key advertiser and developer accounts, advises on monetization and user acquisition strategies using performance insights, collaborates with Product and Engineering as the voice of the local market, and executes localized go-to-market strategies tailored to Korean developers and regional ad-buying behaviors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Account Stewardship: Lead the end-to-end management of a diverse portfolio of developers and advertisers in Korea and Greater China (SMB market), serving as their dedicated growth consultant to optimize revenue and platform performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-Driven Growth Consulting: Analyze complex performance metrics to provide actionable insights, helping clients master the latest ad-tech tools (like Meta’s Andromeda or iOS AMM) to maximize their ROI and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Charket-Powered Social Strategy: Take the lead in building and scaling our local social media service accounts using Charket. You will leverage this integration to provide seamless, data-driven customer service and engagement within the WeChat ecosystem, ensuring a personalized experience for our developer community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital Thought Leadership: Design and host regular localized Webinars to share industry trends and best practices, effectively educating the market and strengthening your position as a trusted APAC industry expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Market Advocacy: Act as the strategic bridge between your clients and our global Product teams, translating local market feedback into product enhancements that keep us at the forefront of the APAC mobile ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrated Data &amp;amp; CRM Operations: Proficiency in the end-to-end growth stack—using Imply for real-time traffic analysis, Looker for performance visualization, and Salesforce to manage day to day operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dual-Sided Portfolio Management: Proven capability to manage both User Acquisition (UA) and Monetization workstreams, balancing aggressive growth spend with sustainable revenue generation (LTV/ARPU).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Segmented Account Strategy: Demonstrated ability to manage a hybrid portfolio, providing high-touch strategic management for VIP Accounts while implementing scalable, automated growth systems for large-scale Long-tail account clusters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tri-Departmental Orchestration: Expert at driving alignment between Business, Product, and Marketing teams to synchronize commercial targets with product roadmaps and multi-channel marketing execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in driving localized operations within the APAC region, with the ability to design and implement differentiated customer management and growth strategies tailored to specific market dynamics, cultural nuances, and regional client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages&lt;strong data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;501&quot;&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in Chinese, Korean, and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might also have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CJK Social Media Expertise: Hands-on experience managing and optimizing mainstream social platforms across China, Japan, and Korea (e.g., WeChat/Red, LINE, KakaoTalk, or X/Twitter) to do customer support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-Driven Social Operations: Familiarity with AI tools for content generation (AIGC), multi-language localization, and social listening to manage and scale accounts across diverse APAC platforms efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support is not available for this position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work visa/immigration sponsorship is not available for this position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Unity, we want our team members to thrive. We offer a wide range of benefits designed to support well-being and work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: Benefits eligibility, specific offerings, and coverage vary based on the country and employment status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While specific benefits vary, here are some of the ways we strive to take care of our eligible team members globally: Comprehensive health, life, and disability insurance | Commute subsidy | Employee stock ownership | Competitive retirement/pension plans | Generous vacation and personal days | Support for new parents through leave and family-care programs | Office food snacks | Mental Health and Wellbeing programs and support | Employee Resource Groups | Global Employee Assistance Program | Training and development programs | Volunteering and donation matching program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Unity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unity [NYSE: U] is the world’s leading game engine, powering play for more than 3 billion consumers each month. The top mobile games in the world, the most played PC indie titles, the most innovative console games, and virtually all of the top XR and Web Games are developed, deployed, and grown in Unity. Unity also enables teams across industries like automotive, manufacturing, and healthcare to design, simulate, and collaborate in 3D — closing the gap between ideas and reality. For more information, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.unity.com/&quot;&gt;www.unity.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Unity is an equal opportunity employer committed to fostering an inclusive, innovative environment with the best employees. Therefore, we provide employment opportunities without regard to age, race, color, ancestry, national origin, disability, gender, or any other protected status in accordance with applicable law. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have a disability that means there are preparations or accommodations we can make to help ensure you have a comfortable and positive interview experience, please fill out &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdrbRLG1N-apH1eahQ622Gypo-rmiAB6LLTP1UsSWQNu7omxQ/viewform&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;this form&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; to let us know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position requires the incumbent to have a sufficient knowledge of English to have professional verbal and written exchanges in this language since the performance of the duties related to this position requires frequent and regular communication with colleagues and partners located worldwide and whose common language is English.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. Unity does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes. Unity will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with Unity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your privacy is important to us. Please take a moment to review our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://unity.com/legal/global-data-privacy-notice-to-prospects&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Prospect&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; and&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://unity.com/de/legal/global-data-privacy-notice-to-applicants&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applicant&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; Privacy Policies. Should you have any concerns about your privacy, please contact us at DPO@unity.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
